Rust and GLSL primitive drafts generated using verified free OpenCode
space-bunny-free, then reviewed and checked locally. Any local corrections
are listed in evidence/VALIDATION.md. This is not an upstream-supported
backend, runs only one checked scalar U32 segment through an adapter, and is not a proof checker.
